VALUES ('Hope for Kids', 'hope-for-kids', 'Hope for Kids Zimbabwe is a registered non-profit organisation (PVO 37/20) operating since 2015 in Manicaland Province, Zimbabwe. It supports orphaned and vulnerable children through education, child protection, and family-strengthening interventions. The organisation also empowers young people through vocational skills, entrepreneurship, livelihoods, and community health programmes.', 'https://www.hopeforkidszimbabwe.com')
