VALUES ('Dzikwa', 'dzikwa', 'Dzikwa Trust, established originally in 2002 and registered as PVO in April 2026, implements a holistic education and wellbeing support program for OVCs in Dzivarasekwa. It operates from its own Activity Center premises at 3147 Rujeko St. DZ 1.', 'https://www.dzikwatrust.org/')
