VALUES ('Nzeve', 'nzeve', 'New Zimbabwe Early Ventures in Education (NZEVE), a registered Private Voluntary Organisation (PVO 22/2005), is an organisation of Deaf and hearing people committed to promoting the rights and inclusion of persons with disabilities. NZEVE provides rehabilitation services, educational support, and economic empowerment initiatives for children, youth, and adults with disabilities.', 'https://www.nzeve.org.zw')
